      "start_seconds": 0.53,
      "end_seconds": 4.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.53,
      "end_seconds": 12.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "okay, come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.06,
      "end_seconds": 16.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "I'm here cos of a swollen red eyelid"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.44,
      "end_seconds": 21.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "how long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.91,
      "end_seconds": 34.82,
      "duration_seconds": 11.91,
      "text": "Probably four weeks. Yeah. I did try to ignore it for a while. I didn't want to make a a fuss you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.58,
      "end_seconds": 38.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "how strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.37,
      "end_seconds": 41.36,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "mostly mild"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.43,
      "end_seconds": 47.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.15,
      "end_seconds": 61.55,
      "duration_seconds": 12.4,
      "text": "honestly every other day. Erm and there's double vision as well two days now. I've also had pain on moving the eye since yesterday"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.84,
      "end_seconds": 65.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.06,
      "end_seconds": 72.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Erm, uh, nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.33,
      "end_seconds": 93.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.52,
      "end_seconds": 98.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Trimethoprim. I come out in... well, a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.48,
      "end_seconds": 104.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "so, are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.76,
      "end_seconds": 108.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "it's amlodipine, once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.21,
      "end_seconds": 114.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.17,
      "end_seconds": 120.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "5 milligrams I think that's what's on the the box"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.78,
      "end_seconds": 123.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "When did you start it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.6,
      "end_seconds": 130.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "about about three months. Telmisartan I don't take anymore"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.79,
      "end_seconds": 137.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.3,
      "end_seconds": 147.53,
      "duration_seconds": 8.23,
      "text": "yes, high blood pressure. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.82,
      "end_seconds": 159.68,
      "duration_seconds": 10.86,
      "text": "sure right, so high blood pressure is already on your record we'll keep that in mind today do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.55,
      "end_seconds": 163.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.47,
      "end_seconds": 169.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.38,
      "end_seconds": 174.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.91,
      "end_seconds": 177.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.32,
      "end_seconds": 184.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.15,
      "end_seconds": 195.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "And what about recent injury or sinus infection?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.69,
      "end_seconds": 199.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.66,
      "end_seconds": 203.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "So your breathing any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.25,
      "end_seconds": 206.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.09,
      "end_seconds": 210.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.2,
      "end_seconds": 213.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.92,
      "end_seconds": 217.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.2,
      "end_seconds": 230.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "So, sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.91,
      "end_seconds": 260.48,
      "duration_seconds": 14.57,
      "text": "okay: BP is 114 over 74, BMI works out to to 25.4, height 155 centimetres, weight 61 kilos, SpO2 96 percent on room air, pulse is 108 beats a minute"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.71,
      "end_seconds": 264.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "could you come over to the couch please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.72,
      "end_seconds": 278.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "sure thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.63,
      "end_seconds": 281.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "nearly finished here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.66,
      "end_seconds": 299.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.85,
      "text": "the the eyelid is swollen shut, the eye is bulging and the movements are painful and limited"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.31,
      "end_seconds": 313.85,
      "duration_seconds": 8.54,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Okay thinking it it through this is probably orbital cellulitis. I can't rule out periorbital cellulitis yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.41,
      "end_seconds": 317.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.26,
      "end_seconds": 344.73,
      "duration_seconds": 22.47,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's orbital cellulitis and we'll know more once the blood tests is back i'm going to order blood tests for orbital cellulitis you need admission today for intravenous antibiotics the eye team would be the right next step I'll refer you book a review straight away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.34,
      "end_seconds": 347.04,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.81,
      "end_seconds": 351.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.84,
      "end_seconds": 357.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "so, I come back straight away is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.8,
      "end_seconds": 364.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.11,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.04,
      "end_seconds": 368.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    },
